{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>北京有商會舉辦迎新活動，歡迎到北京上學的港澳台大學生。</p><p></p><p>迎新活動一連兩日舉行，以「相聚北京，共舉情誼」為主題，有共150名學生參加，一起參觀北京不同景點。第一站去到國家博物館，欣賞不同年代反映中國歷史的文物。之後再到訪正陽門箭樓。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BJ.STUDENTS-2000_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026DvOYmX6iu11792237804.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>學生亦聽取十五五規劃講座，了解中國式現代化發展藍圖。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T12:19:11.557979+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T11:43:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T13:57:39.991449+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T12:17:35.649331+00:00","content_hash":"b0f3b0dbf7b91b60410c09ee9218f2bb549060b4137258b44331d1f7276906f0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}